  "description": "MCPBuckle is a comprehensive .NET library that generates Model Context Protocol (MCP) JSON from ASP.NET Core API metadata with full MCPInvoke 1.4.0+ compatibility. Features advanced schema generation with route parameter extraction, parameter source detection, and complex object introspection. Provides multiple discovery endpoints and works alongside Swashbuckle to enable AI agent discovery and execution of your APIs.",
